<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes Chemical.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes Chemical.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Great Lakes Chemical Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Great Lakes closed Friday at 46-7/8.</p>
